==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]], [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]], [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Eraser Cat]], [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Class Rep Cat]], [[Principal Cat (Special Cat)|Principal Cat]] and [[Occultist Cat (Special Cat)|Occultist Cat]]

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Confessional Tree (Enemy Base)|Confessional Tree]].
*1 [[Dark Wind]] (400%) spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Wind]] (400%) spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] spawns after 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Wind]] (400%) spawns after 35 seconds<sup>1,050f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 32.67~33.33 seconds<sup>980f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 32.67~33.33 seconds<sup>980f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 21.67 seconds<sup>650f</sup>, delay 32.67~33.33 seconds<sup>980f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 32.67~33.33 seconds<sup>980f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Wind]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Dark Wind]]s (400%) spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Red Wind]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Dark Wind]]s (400%) spawn, delay 8.33~10 seconds<sup>250f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Red Wind]]s spawn, delay 8.33~10 seconds<sup>250f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam any of the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]]  units to win, and a [[Cat Combo]] if you need it.

